## Where things live

- `docs/` -- the normative specification (this site).
- `docs/features/<name>/1.0.yaml` -- the **source of truth** for every feature's
  attributes, enums, and commands. Both the rendered "Features" pages here and
  the Go reference implementation are generated from these files.
- `mash-go/` -- the Go reference implementation. Build, conformance harness,
  and CLI tools (`mash-device`, `mash-controller`, `mash-test`).
- `docs/decision-log.md` -- every design choice with the alternatives we
  rejected and why; cited inline as `DEC-NNN`.

